[{"client_msg_id":"2545a4e3-d22b-4b3a-9327-c99bcaf18823","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"お、私がやったときなぜうまく行かなかったんだろう。何かバグが治ったのかな","ts":"1632224282.134100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bJkhz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df32242f-f1a5-4caf-93a8-028e13be5b5c","type":"message","user":"U01G63H9VN3","text":"確かにあまりカラフルにはならないですね","ts":"1632219665.133300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ya06"}]},{"client_msg_id":"997682de-4a58-4969-b5d4-03dd78ca9374","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"tree-sitterのVimのやつなんか微妙で抜いちゃったな","ts":"1632219603.132800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HYXF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5586c16-63cf-40eb-a825-510a19f6b0f6","type":"message","user":"U01G63H9VN3","text":"`after/queries/toml/injections.scm` にこれを書くことで、dein.vimのtomlのhook_*にtreesitterのVimハイライトが効くようになりました。\n```((pair\n\t(bare_key) @_key\n\t(string) @vim)\n  (#vim-match? @_key \"^hook_\\w*\"))```","ts":"1632219306.131600","thread_ts":"1632219306.131600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U8R597E9H","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ohn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cdb4f80-61c8-41ab-a097-449c04a60a93","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"安定してるのはそうですね。他と比較して特徴的な機能はないです","ts":"1632176373.130700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gv8Cy"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02F181EM42","text":"\u003c@U02F181EM42\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632158489.129800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"de3fdb1a-600e-4b19-833f-d173c3efa3b3","type":"message","user":"U01G63H9VN3","text":"これの方がいいな\n```((pair\n  (bare_key) @_key\n  (string) @vim)\n (#vim-match? @_key \"^hook_\\w*\"))\n((table\n  (bare_key) @_key\n  (pair\n    (string) @vim))\n  (#eq? @_key \"ftplugin\"))\n((table\n  (dotted_key) @_key\n  (pair\n    (string) @vim))\n  (#eq? @_key \"plugins.ftplugin\"))```","ts":"1632224195.133600","thread_ts":"1632219306.131600","parent_user_id":"U01G63H9VN3","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bsTU"}]}]
